#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:2
msgid "Core Concepts"
msgstr "核心概念"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:4
msgid ""
"q2m3 combines quantum chemistry, quantum algorithms, and molecular mechanics. The "
":doc:`/glossary` defines the terms used below."
msgstr "q2m3 结合量子化学、量子算法和分子力学。:doc:`/glossary` 定义下文使用的术语。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:8
msgid "QM/MM Partitioning"
msgstr "QM/MM 分区"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:10
msgid ""
"QM/MM separates a system into a quantum mechanical region and a molecular mechanics environment. "
"q2m3 currently uses PySCF for the classical quantum chemistry side and TIP3P/SPC/E-style point "
"charges for explicit water environments. q2m3 stores energies in Hartree internally. The unit "
"kcal/mol appears only after an explicit conversion."
msgstr ""
"QM/MM 将体系分为量子力学区域和分子力学环境。q2m3 目前使用 PySCF 完成经典量子化学计算，并以 TIP3P/SPC/E 式点电荷表示显式水环境。q2m3 内部以 Hartree "
"存储能量，仅在显式转换后使用 kcal/mol。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:16
msgid ""
"The current embedding model is electrostatic point-charge embedding. It does not include a "
"polarizable MM force field or advanced solvent response model."
msgstr "当前嵌入模型为静电点电荷嵌入，不包含可极化 MM 力场或高级溶剂响应模型。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:20
msgid "QPE Workflow"
msgstr "QPE 工作流"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:22
msgid ""
"QPE estimates an eigenphase of the time-evolution operator and converts that phase back into an "
"energy. The PennyLane QPE paths prepare an HF state, apply controlled Trotter time evolution and "
"inverse QFT, and decode the phase. A classical fallback tests the QM/MM data pipeline when no "
"PennyLane Hamiltonian is available."
msgstr ""
"QPE 估计时间演化算符的本征相位，再将相位转换为能量。PennyLane QPE 路径制备 HF 态，执行受控 Trotter 时间演化和逆 QFT，然后解码相位。没有 PennyLane "
"哈密顿量时，经典后备路径可测试 QM/MM 数据管线。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:45
msgid "Active Spaces"
msgstr "活性空间"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:47
msgid ""
"Active-space truncation reduces the simulation size. Report the active electrons, spatial "
"orbitals, and resulting qubit count. For Jordan-Wigner mappings, each spatial orbital contributes"
" two spin-orbital qubits."
msgstr "活性空间截断可缩小模拟规模。报告活性电子数、空间轨道数和量子比特数。Jordan-Wigner 映射中，每个空间轨道对应两个自旋轨道量子比特。"

