msgid "SQD scaling tutorial. Each space has its own Hamiltonian and reference"
msgstr "SQD 规模扩展教程。每个活性空间都有独立的哈密顿量和参考计算"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:71
msgid ""
"The full H3O+ STO-3G space is larger than the default examples. The public H3O+ scripts therefore"
" use conservative active-space and Trotter settings."
msgstr "完整 H3O+ STO-3G 空间大于默认示例。因此，公开 H3O+ 脚本采用保守的活性空间和 Trotter 设置。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:75
msgid "Sample-Based Quantum Diagonalization"
msgstr "基于采样的量子对角化"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:77
msgid ""
"SQD samples a CCSD-seeded LUCJ state with ffsim. It diagonalizes the Hamiltonian in the recovered"
" determinant subspace. The result includes HF, active-space CCSD, selected-CI, random-subspace, "
"and reference energies. All comparisons use the same Hamiltonian. See :doc:`sqd` for the "
"reference policy."
msgstr ""
"SQD 使用 ffsim 采样以 CCSD 为种子的 LUCJ 态。它在恢复的行列式子空间中对角化哈密顿量。结果包含 HF、活性空间 CCSD、选择 "
"CI、随机子空间和参考能量。所有比较使用同一哈密顿量。参考策略见 :doc:`sqd`。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:82
msgid ""
"The signed primary error is ``1000 * (E_SQD - E_reference)`` in mHa, so a positive value places "
"SQD above the reference. Only a T0 exact-active-space result supports an exact-error claim. Seed "
"spread is descriptive. It is not a confidence interval. The sampled determinant fraction also "
"does not equal simulator-memory savings because ffsim still represents the full fixed-particle-"
"number state."
msgstr ""
"主要带符号误差为 ``1000 * (E_SQD - E_reference)``，单位 mHa；正值表示 SQD 高于参考能量。只有 T0 "
"活性空间内精确结果才支持精确误差声明。种子离散程度是描述性统计，不是置信区间。采样行列式比例也不等于模拟器内存节省比例，因为 ffsim 仍表示完整的固定粒子数态。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:89
msgid ""
"SQD runs on a classical simulator. It does not execute on quantum hardware or demonstrate quantum"
" advantage."
msgstr "SQD 在经典模拟器上运行。它不执行量子硬件计算，也不证明量子优势。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:93
msgid "Fragment interaction energies"
msgstr "片段相互作用能"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:95
msgid ""
"The fragment workflow computes ``E(AB) - E(A) - E(B)`` for a dimer. Counterpoise uses the dimer "
"basis for all three calculations. AVAS selects active orbitals from explicit atomic-shell labels "
"and a threshold. The workflow checks correspondence between the dimer and monomer active spaces."
msgstr ""
"片段工作流为二聚体计算 ``E(AB) - E(A) - E(B)``。Counterpoise 在三个计算中均使用二聚体基组。AVAS "
"根据显式原子壳层标签和阈值选择活性轨道。工作流检查二聚体与单体活性空间的对应关系。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:100
msgid ""
"``classical_only`` computes HF and frozen-core MP2. ``full`` adds budgeted CCSD(T), active-space "
"SQD, and resource estimates. Only a T0 exact-CASCI reference supplies the CASCI energy. Missing "
"reference values remain absent with reasons. See :doc:`/tutorials/fragment-interaction` for a "
"complete calculation."
msgstr ""
"``classical_only`` 计算 HF 和冻结芯 MP2。``full`` 增加受预算限制的 CCSD(T)、活性空间 SQD 和资源估算。只有 T0 exact-CASCI 参考提供"
" CASCI 能量。缺失的参考值保留为空并附带原因。完整计算见 :doc:`/tutorials/fragment-interaction`。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:106
msgid ""
"These interaction energies describe fixed geometries. They do not represent a solvent ensemble or"
" a solvation free energy."
msgstr "这些相互作用能描述固定几何，不代表溶剂系综或溶剂化自由能。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:110
msgid "Phase Decoding And Energy Shifts"
msgstr "相位解码与能量平移"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:112
msgid ""
"QPE measures a phase modulo one. Large negative molecular energies can therefore produce phase "
"wrapping. When needed, q2m3 uses shifted QPE parameters to estimate a smaller energy difference "
"relative to a Hartree-Fock reference."
msgstr "QPE 测量模一相位，因此较大的负分子能量可能产生相位回绕。必要时，q2m3 使用平移后的 QPE 参数，估计相对 Hartree-Fock 参考的较小能量差。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:117
msgid "Two phase-extraction conventions exist in the current code:"
msgstr "当前代码存在两种相位提取约定："

