#: ../../source/user-guide/core-concepts.rst:229
msgid ""
"The current dynamic runtime coefficient path updates diagonal coefficients. It does not accept "
"``embedding_mode=\"full_oneelectron\"`` because off-diagonal one-electron terms can change the "
"operator support that Catalyst compiled for a given circuit."
